# Living Planner: UX & UI Improvement Suggestions

After auditing every component, here are targeted improvements organized by theme. The guiding principle: **understated confidence, not performative enthusiasm.**

---

## 🚩 Tone & Copy — Kill the Cheese

The single biggest improvement. Gen Z can smell forced enthusiasm from a mile away. The current copy reads like a LinkedIn motivational post. It should read like a chill friend who happens to be organized.

| Location | Current (Cheesy) | Suggested (Understated) |
|:---|:---|:---|
| [CompanionPanel](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx#24-134) mood: happy | *"I'm feeling great! Let's crush those goals."* | *"good day. keep going."* |
| [CompanionPanel](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx#24-134) mood: neutral | *"Stable systems. Ready for the next task."* | *"standing by."* |
| [CompanionPanel](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx#24-134) mood: sleepy | *"A bit quiet today... shall we start small?"* | *"...still here."* |
| [CompanionPanel](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx#24-134) mood: zen | *"Absolute focus. You're doing amazing."* | *"locked in."* |
| [CompanionPanel](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/companion/CompanionPanel.tsx#24-134) mood: energized | *"Power levels rising! You're on a roll."* | *"on a streak. don't stop."* |
